* eeg_chip: the whole chip with its pad ring, for the full-chip LVS (written by
* chip_lay.chip_netlist(); do not edit): eeg_core's body (eeg_core.spice) and the pad
* ring's 76 IO cells and 682 fillers (pad_geometry.json, the padring GDS).
* IO cells: the PDK's gf180mcu_fd_io.cdl (chip_lay.io_cdl()); their DVDD / VDD pins are
* the chip's DVDD, DVSS / VSS its DVSS. Unused analog pads keep their own nets (NC_*).
